WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.605 --> 00:00:11.764
A course with no session yet:
its first session opens by itself.

2
00:00:11.865 --> 00:00:19.013
Filled in: a lecture, Mon 08:20, in the
weeks most sessions this term use.

3
00:00:19.113 --> 00:00:27.209
Move it and choose a room –
“Annað” means no room yet.

4
00:00:27.309 --> 00:00:32.279
“Vista án bókunar”: save it in Spoi,
book it later.

5
00:00:36.382 --> 00:00:42.324
This tutorial and the orange booking
are one class, not linked.

6
00:00:42.424 --> 00:00:47.324
Spoi suggests the match:
the booking pulses.

7
00:00:47.424 --> 00:00:51.325
Right-click the booking to pair them.

8
00:00:51.425 --> 00:00:56.495
Saved: the session is green,
at its booked time.

9
00:01:00.599 --> 00:01:06.500
A session with no time:
click it under “Ekki tímasett”.

10
00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:12.501
Choose a Tímasetning (time) –
it moves onto the calendar.

11
00:01:12.601 --> 00:01:18.503
Pick a room. “Engir árekstrar”:
no clashes – a good position.

12
00:01:18.603 --> 00:01:22.989
Staðfesta og vista (confirm and save).

13
00:01:27.092 --> 00:01:33.992
Double-click empty space for a new
session – a two-slot lecture by default.

14
00:01:34.092 --> 00:01:41.733
Choose its weeks – drag across
the chips to pick many at once.

15
00:01:41.833 --> 00:01:46.792
Saved – blue, because
it is not booked yet.

16
00:01:46.892 --> 00:01:53.254
To delete: “Eyða tíma”, then save.

17
00:01:53.354 --> 00:02:00.254
A booked session can't be deleted here –
remove its booking first (1c).
